(7509873, 1198307, 98565, '<td valign="top">Sorry Susie - this is of course no sensible comment <br/>something went wrong...must have hit the wrong button in the wrong moment.<br/> <br/>I just wanted to make sure that this is an IR and not snow because it can easily be mistaken (It''s snowing heavily right now where I live)<br/>You''re right, the conditions might have been better for this technique - I personally would have liked the sky to stand out more and a little bit more sharpness.<br/>Do you own an IR-filter? Or did you achieve this look with photoshop?</td>', 'Sorry Susie - this is of course no sensible comment something went wrong...must have hit the wrong button in the wrong moment. I just wanted to make sure that this is an IR and not snow because it can easily be mistaken (It''s snowing heavily right now where I live)You''re right, the conditions might have been better for this technique - I personally would have liked the sky to stand out more and a little bit more sharpness.Do you own an IR-filter? Or did you achieve this look with photoshop?', '2017-04-19 02:41:37.000000', NULL, 0),
