(7509877, 1198262, 185714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cyrilda:</b></div><hr/><i> Very creative and fits the challenge well. Love it! 10 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much Cyrilda for your vote.  You had made my day when I saw your comment during voting.  Truly appreciated.  When I saw my score fluctuated like "Stock Market", OMG, heart followed.<br/> <br/>Sharing my concept for this image.  This is a daily life of cloth pegs.  Day &amp; night they served.  The day when they were not in used, they felt empty &amp; lonely.  They were hopeful every single day, that they had company to cling on.</td>', 'Originally posted by Cyrilda: Very creative and fits the challenge well. Love it! 10   Thank you so much Cyrilda for your vote.  You had made my day when I saw your comment during voting.  Truly appreciated.  When I saw my score fluctuated like "Stock Market", OMG, heart followed. Sharing my concept for this image.  This is a daily life of cloth pegs.  Day & night they served.  The day when they were not in used, they felt empty & lonely.  They were hopeful every single day, that they had company to cling on.', '2017-04-19 03:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7509878, 1198262, 185714, '<td valign="top">Thank you DPC members for making an effort to view &amp; vote for my image.<br/> <br/>Sharing my concept to this image.  <br/> <br/>"This is a daily life of cloth pegs. Day &amp; night they served. The day when they were not in used, they felt empty &amp; lonely. They were hopeful every single day, that they had company to cling on."<br/> <br/>By looking at the score chart, it varies.  Guess this concept has a mixed liking. I will do my best the next time round. <br/> <br/>Thank you once again for showing some interests in my image. <br/> <br/>Cheers <br/>Gin Tay<br/></td>', 'Thank you DPC members for making an effort to view & vote for my image. Sharing my concept to this image.   "This is a daily life of cloth pegs. Day & night they served. The day when they were not in used, they felt empty & lonely. They were hopeful every single day, that they had company to cling on." By looking at the score chart, it varies.  Guess this concept has a mixed liking. I will do my best the next time round.  Thank you once again for showing some interests in my image.  Cheers Gin Tay', '2017-04-19 03:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7509879, 1198262, 185714, '<td valign="top">Thank you DPC members for making an effort to view &amp; vote for my image.<br/> <br/>Sharing my concept to this image.  <br/> <br/>"This is a daily life of cloth pegs. Day &amp; night they served. The day when they were not in used, they felt empty &amp; lonely. They were hopeful every single day, that they had company to cling on."<br/> <br/>By looking at the score chart, it varies.  Guess this concept has a mixed liking. I will do my best the next time round. <br/> <br/>Thank you once again for showing some interests in my image. <br/> <br/>Cheers <br/>Gin Tay<br/></td>', 'Thank you DPC members for making an effort to view & vote for my image. Sharing my concept to this image.   "This is a daily life of cloth pegs. Day & night they served. The day when they were not in used, they felt empty & lonely. They were hopeful every single day, that they had company to cling on." By looking at the score chart, it varies.  Guess this concept has a mixed liking. I will do my best the next time round.  Thank you once again for showing some interests in my image.  Cheers Gin Tay', '2017-04-19 03:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
